	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Diucius committere non possum, quin te amicum unice observabilem salutem, ruat interim <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cęlum et parturient montes.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">tu tuique sunt mihi preciosissimi super aurum et topastam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ut tu valeas, avide scire cupio.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego <placeName ref="l245">Kauffburnęgenus</placeName> plane Scithicum dego, ubi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>aedes pro uxore et liberis emi, ad quas, si quando dominus me ad se vocaverit, diversui<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ri sunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Abstulissent profecto me iamdudum tum temporis iniuria tum pietatis verę <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>interitus, nisi dominus singulares mentis vires tribuisset.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed age, cur tocies prę<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sagita et in promptu stans calamitas vobis tam diu pręcavetur?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Certe a domino <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>est, qui hostes hostibus implicat, suos a malis tantisper liberaturus; cui laus, honor, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>virtus et gloria perpetim, amen.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Rerum novarum nihil habeo aliud, quam quod rex <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quidam barbarus apud barbares quidem et <placeName>Arabes</placeName> paulo ante prodierit, qui <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tam <placeName ref="l875">Hispanis</placeName> quam regi <placeName ref="l2530">Portugallię</placeName> innumeras civitates vi et armis debellavit <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>atque in suam dicionem coegit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Id haud dubie quędam immutavit consilia; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>id, inquam, dominus fortis fęcit facturusque est mirabilia multa solus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l749">Saxones</placeName> et <placeName ref="l1682">Misnenses</placeName> crebro scribunt ad amicos nostratium sese adhuc ab Interim <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>esse immunes et liberos, ducem autem <persName ref="p18250">Mauricium</persName> adeo furiis exagitari, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ut requiem non capiet, nisi vel vino vel scortacione plęnum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">perseverant <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>autem <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> in anathemate ipsis inflicto; utinam vere pie agant cum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sciencia et non tantum periculi partem ob supersticionem paciantur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Cęsar nulli <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>curialium intra plures dies est visus; principe <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniorum</placeName> hincinde ambulante <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ipse <placeName ref="l1284">Bruxellę</placeName> dicitur delitescere.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quid futurum sit, nescio.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> evangelium <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>adhuc predicatur, si modo id sine correpcione pravorum morum, impietatis et <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>idololatrieę fieri potest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Filius mihi quasi unicus est <persName ref="p20383">Ionas Lętus</persName>, qui ab optimo viro D. <persName ref="p4868">Iacobo <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Funcklio</persName> et fratre meo <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosio Blaurero</persName> prima elementa didicit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Illum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nunc propter preceptorum penuriam domi foveo, sciens quam male negligatur <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>puer bonę spei.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Si ergo poteris illi pro pecunia tolerabili prospicere, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ut <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> literis imbuatur et alatur, oro te per Christum, ut rescribas; <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quem tuo tandem consilio propediem ad te missur<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>us s<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>um<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Scribe <persName ref="p8055">Blaurero</persName> meo, si fieri commode potest, me eundem erga ipsum esse, qui <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>semper fui, nil me magis anxium reddere, quam quod exulantem ipsum nec <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>solai nec iuvare queam.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Possem quidem solari, si literę tuto ad eum perferri <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>queant; possem et iuvare, nisi facultates minores essent, quam ut magnę <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>necessitati succurrant.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Fac me cerciorem, ubi agant fratres laureri, <persName ref="p4082">Zviccius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>et <persName ref="p4868">Iacobus Funcklius</persName>; <persName ref="p2923">Gabrielem</persName> <placeName ref="l587">Tyguri</placeName> esse opinor.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quos singulos una <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>cum singulis tuis symmistis, consulibus et scribis salvos esse percipio.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Vale.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">15. iulii anno 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8354">G[<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>eorgius] L[aetus</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem errnhafften unnd hochgelerten <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>herren <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullinger</persName> <placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName> etc. meinem inn<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>sonnders gunnstigen, lieben <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>herren, ze hannden.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
